/Title (A Robust and Fast System for CTC Computer-Aided Detection of Colorectal Lesions)
/Author (Greg Slabaugh, Xiaoyun Yang, Xujiong Ye, Richard Boyes, Gareth Beddoe)
/Creator (LaTeX with hyperref package)
/ModDate (D:20100210203859Z)
/Subject (We present a complete, end-to-end computer-aided detection \(CAD\) system for\r\nidentifying lesions in the colon, imaged with computed tomography \(CT\). This system\r\nincludes facilities for colon segmentation, candidate generation, feature analysis, and\r\nclassification. The algorithms have been designed to offer robust performance to variation\r\nin image data and patient preparation. By utilizing efficient 2D and 3D processing, software\r\noptimizations, multi-threading, feature selection, and an optimized cascade classifier, the\r\nCAD system quickly determines a set of detection marks. The colon CAD system has been\r\nvalidated on the largest set of data to date, and demonstrates excellent performance, in terms\r\nof its high sensitivity, low false positive rate, and computational efficiency.)
/Keywords (CAD; colorectal lesion detection; pattern recognition)
/Producer (PDF-XChange Viewer [Version: 2.0 \(Build 40.7\) \(Nov 25 2008; 17:31:42\)])
/CreationDate (D:20100105161452+08'00')
/PTEX.Fullbanner (This is pdfTeX, Version 3.141592-1.20b \(MiKTeX 2.4.1986\))
>>
endobj
